"十","shí","a"],["三","sān","a"],"，",["叩","kòu","p"],["爾","ěr","a"],["胸","xiōng","o"],["中","zhōng","o"],"，",["則","zé","a"],["皆","jiē","d"],["未","wèi","p"],["有","yǒu","p"],["卓","zhuó","o"],["吾","wú","o"],["先","xiān","o"],["生","shēng","p"],["者","zhě","o"],["也","yě","d"],"。"],"ja":[["しかし","","f"],"、",["その","","a"],["文章","ぶんしょう","o"],["を","","f"],["奇","き","d"],["と","","f"],["する","","p"],["者","もの","s"],["は","","f"],["十","じゅう","a"],["の","","f"],["うち","","o"],["七","なな","o"],"、",["その","","a"],["人物","じんぶつ","o"],["を","","f"],["奇","き","d"],["と","","f"],["する","","p"],["者","もの","s"],["は","","f"],["十","じゅう","a"],["の","","f"],["うち","","o"],["三","さん","d"],["に","","f"],["すぎ","","p"],["ない","","p"],"。",["彼","かれ","o"],["ら","","a"],["の","","f"],["胸中","きょうちゅう","o"],["を","","f"],["問","と","p"],["いただし","","p"],["て","","f"],["みれ","","p"],["ば","","f"],"、",["誰","だれ","o"],["一人","ひとり","d"],["と","","f"],["し","","p"],["て","","f"],["卓吾先生","たくごせんせい","o"],["を","","f"],["心","こころ","d"],["に","","f"],["宿","やど","p"],["し","","p"],["て","","f"],["は","","f"],["い","","p"],["ない","","p"],["の","","f"],["で","","f"],["ある","","p"],"。"],"src":"Yet seven in ten marvel at his writings, while only three in ten marvel at the man himself; sound their hearts, and not one of them truly has Master Zhuowu within."}]},{"id":"water-margin-120-s0005-p000025","src":"After I journeyed to Wu, I visited His Excellency Chen Wuyi and there came to know Yuan Wuya. Before our greetings were even finished, he at once began asking about the Master. The sincerity of his private discipleship shone from his brow; it seemed that he truly had Zhuowu within his heart. Thereafter we met and talked several times, and our conversation invariably turned to Elder Zhuo. He sought Elder Zhuo's surviving words with the utmost eagerness, and with equal eagerness sought the books Elder Zhuo had annotated and left behind. Was Wuya mad? Or was it an obsession? I searched my travelling case, in which I had with me two works revised and settled by Master Zhuowu—the Loyal and Righteous Water Margin and the Collected Works of Yang Sheng'an—and brought them out to give to him. Wuya rejoiced as though he had gained a priceless treasure and wished to make the books public throughout the world. I asked, “Which of the two books should come first?” Wuya said, “The Water Margin is loyalty and righteousness, and loyalty and righteousness are the Water Margin. ‘Those who understand me and those who condemn me’—Elder Zhuo's own Spring and Autumn judgment lies close to this. Let the Water Margin come first! Let the Water Margin come first!” I laughed and said, “Yes, yes! None but Elder Zhuo could reveal the true spirit of the Water Margin, and none but Wuya could reveal the true spirit of Elder Zhuo. I have served Master Zhuowu the longest, yet it is Wuya who has grasped Master Zhuowu most profoundly. I am ashamed before Wuya! Yet if not for me, who else could have revealed the true spirit of Wuya? I have not failed Master Zhuowu, nor has Wuya failed the purpose of my journey here.” Then we looked at one another and laughed, brewed tea and drank together, and took up Master Zhuowu's preface to the Loyal and Righteous Water Margin and read it aloud in unison. The raging waves of the Xu River seemed to answer us. I forgot Wuya, and Wuya forgot me; we knew only that there was Master Zhuowu.","u":[{"en":[["After","","f"]," ",["I","","s"]," ",["journeyed","","p"]," ",["to","","f"]," ",["Wu","","d"],","," ",["I","","s"]," ",["visited","","p"]," ",["His","","a"]," ",["Excellency","","o"]," ",["Chen","","o"]," ",["Wuyi","","o"]," ",["and","","f"]," ",["there","","d"]," ",["came","","p"]," ",["to","","f"]," ",["know","","p"]," ",["Yuan","","o"]," ",["Wuya","","o"],"."," "],"zh":[["自","zì","f"],["吾","wú","d"],["游","yóu","p"],["吳","wú","f"],"，",["訪","fǎng","f"],["陳","chén","f"],["無","wú","a"],["異","yì","a"],["使","shǐ","p"],["君","jūn","p"],"，",["而","ér","f"],["得","dé","f"],["袁","yuán","o"],["無","wú","a"],["涯","yá","o"],["氏","shì","o"],"。"],"ja":